@startuml "Memento - Incremental Changes (Homework) - Class Diagram"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title A memento that holds only the cells an edit changed
class Sheet <<Originator>> {
  - cells : Map<String, Integer>
  + set(Map<String, Integer>) : Change
  + undo(Change)
  + get(String) : int
}
class "Sheet.Change" as Change <<Memento>> {
  - oldValues : Map<String, Integer>
  + size() : int
}
class Main <<Caretaker>>
Sheet ..> Change : creates, reads
Main --> Change : keeps
Main --> Sheet
note bottom of Change
  Holds the old values of the
  changed cells, not the whole sheet.
end note
@enduml
